Subject: [PATCH] security: support DHCP setup and optional management IP policy

Validate direct HTTPS origins against the local TLS socket, retain explicit
origins, and make IP admission optional for new web setup. Preserve existing
restrictions during the transactional revision-6 migration. Retain password,
role, lockout, CSRF, session binding and single-session protections. Include
backend and web regressions and the administrator policy controls.

Upstream-Status: Pending [firmware repository integration]

